
This article is a '''list of [[Hot Wheels]]''' released in '''2007''' which consisted of 36 New Models ("First Editions" in previous years), 12 Treasure Hunts, First Year for the 12 Super Treasure Hunts, 12 "Teams" of 4 cars each ("Segment Series" in previous years), 12 Track Stars, 24 Code cars, and 24 Mystery Cars.

